 "instructions": "<div><p><b>Demographic Survey/U.S. Equal Employment Opportunity Information</b></p></div><p>To ensure that we comply with reporting requirements and to learn more about how we can increase diversity in our candidate pool, we invite you to provide demographic information in a confidential survey.</p><p>Providing this information is optional. It will not be used in the hiring process, and has no effect on your opportunity for employment.</p><p>DraftKings ensures equal employment opportunity without discrimination or harassment based on race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, age, disability, national origin, marital or domestic/civil partnership status, genetic information, citizenship status, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.</p><p></p><p><i>By clicking &#34;Next&#34; below, I consent to DraftKings\u2019 collection and use of my sensitive personal information, including race or ethnicity and sexual orientation data for purposes of evaluating our Inclusion, Equity, &amp; Belonging initiatives. The provision of such information is optional. You may withdraw your consent by emailing <a href=\"mailto:privacy&#64;draftkings.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span>privacy&#64;draftkings.com</span></a>. For details about DraftKings\u2019 collection and use of your information, please see our </i><a href=\"https://careers.draftkings.com/media/x3ann3n3/dk-careers-website-privacy-notice-06-10-21.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy Notice</a><i>.</i></p>",
